{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1521420-scale-dragon","id":1521420,"title":"Scale? (Dragon)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-26T00:12:10-07:00","id":1521420,"title":"Scale? (Dragon)","content":"In the Dragon book I found myself puzzling over this passage about taking Draconic form.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Heir gains +1 Scale on all actions, which doesn\u2019t stack with any Scale benefits from Knacks or other sources; if two sources would grant Scale, use the highest bonus among them.&quot;<br /> <br /> This seems to fly in the face of other points in the book where scale does stack. And then there are transformation knacks that seem useless in this form as their scale benefits do nothing?<br /> <br /> Can someone help me to understand why I simply wouldn't just stay in human form and stack Abilities for scale as opposed to taking Draconic form and losing that?<br /> <br /> Am I reading this correctly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8177-heroofthemists","name":"Heroofthemists","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-26T13:27:37-07:00","id":1521443,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve read Dragon, but based on what you wrote you get +1 Scale on everything which is beneficial when you don\u2019t have something else to give you Scale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":